  "evidencia": "Page: Kevin Rowland. Sentence: Kevin Antony Rowland (born 17 August 1953) is an English born singer-songwriter of Irish descent and frontman for the pop band Dexys Midnight Runners (currently called Dexys), which had several hits in the early 1980s, the most notable being \"Geno\" and \"Come On Eileen\", both of which reached Number One in the U.K. singles charts.\nPage: Lauri Ylönen. Sentence: Lauri Ylönen (born 23 April 1979) is a Finnish singer-songwriter, best known as the frontman of the Finnish alternative rock band The Rasmus.\nPage: My Beauty. Sentence: My Beauty is a solo album by Kevin Rowland, lead singer of Dexys Midnight Runners.",
