        "original_id": "8d1111e5-1aa8-5ae4-b1c5-142668dc7eb4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Rowland, Lauri Ylönen\n- Bands: Dexys Midnight Runners, Dexys, The Rasmus\n- Products: My Beauty, \"Geno\", \"Come On Eileen\"\n- Roles: singer-songwriters, frontmen\n\nFacts:\n- Kevin Rowland was born on 17 August 1953.\n- Kevin Rowland is an English-born singer-songwriter of Irish descent.\n- Kevin Rowland was the frontman of the pop band Dexys Midnight Runners, now called Dexys.\n- Dexys Midnight Runners had several hits in the early 1980s, including \"Geno\" and \"Come On Eileen\".\n- \"Geno\" and \"Come On Eileen\" both reached number one on the U.K. singles chart.\n- Lauri Ylönen was born on 23 April 1979.\n- Lauri Ylönen is a Finnish singer-songwriter.\n- Lauri Ylönen is best known as the frontman of the Finnish alternative rock band The Rasmus.\n- My Beauty is a solo album by Kevin Rowland.\n- Kevin Rowland was the lead singer of Dexys Midnight Runners.",
